  "goodToKnow": "Die Bevormundung is paternalism or patronising treatment: staatliche Bevormundung, sich gegen Bevormundung wehren. Bans on things like smoking, speed or certain foods are often criticised as Bevormundung, and the opposite ideal is der mündige Bürger (the responsible, autonomous citizen). Der Vormund is a legal guardian, and bevormunden to patronise. Plural: die Bevormundungen."
